                                "sense_id": "28ff0ad9-5b6c-35a5-aed9-07e807c5e1da",
                                "text": "It was an understood thing in our squadron that no one was on any account to bring the Baron down, but some of our pilots had come close enough to see his beetling brows and purple cheeks reflected in octuplicate."
